Adventurer,

Allhallows is just around the corner, with Albion=E2=80=99s adventurers pre=
paring their scariest outfits and getting ready to cause a fright. And just=
 in time, the horrifying *Demonic Warrior Vanity Bundle ( https://albiononl=
ine.com/news/demonic-warrior-sale )* is now on sale until *October 31 at 10=
:00 UTC* !

This premiere bundle contains a full costume set, along with the infernal *=
Saddled Hellhound Mount Skin* for your *Direwolf* base mount. As you approa=
ch encased in dark, jagged armor upon the back of this snarling beast, you=
=E2=80=99re sure to strike terror into the hearts of your foes.

This offer is available to all players through the new *Albion Online Shop*=
 ( https://albiononline.com/shop/ ) , the native client, the Steam client, =
and Google Play. Check out the store now and take advantage of this deal wh=
ile it lasts!

( https://albiononline.com/news/devtalk-roads-revisited )

