Albion=E2=80=99s next major content update, *Beyond the Veil* , and introdu=
ces some major changes coming to the *Roads of Avalon*.

Click the video below to watch his talk:

( https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DUnGPr1C03Xg )

Prefer a written summary? Then click *here* ( https://albiononline.com/news=
/devtalk-roads-revisited ).

