----------------------

The new *Albion Online Shop* ( https://albiononline.com/shop/ ) is live, of=
fering the best prices on Gold, Premium, and - for the first time - Vanity =
Skins and Bundles! Head over there to pick up the *Demonic Warrior* today, =
and see what else is available:

